WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.260
The family was in the kitchen, planning to shop for school supplies.

2
00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:11.660
Vinnie and Mandy were about to start at a new school.

3
00:00:11.661 --> 00:00:15.013
But they weren’t very excited.

4
00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:19.185
"Come on, you’ll make new friends!" said Dad.

5
00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:22.852
"Yeah, I know," Vinnie sighed.

6
00:00:22.853 --> 00:00:28.790
"But they won’t be the same friends," said Mandy unhappily.

7
00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:34.357
The children were sad because their photo trips were almost over.

8
00:00:34.358 --> 00:00:38.075
Only one page was left in the album.

9
00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:41.005
Just then the phone rang.

10
00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:43.653
It was Dad’s boss.

11
00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:47.687
"Sorry, but I need some privacy," said Dad.

12
00:00:47.688 --> 00:00:51.289
"No problem, Dad," said Vinnie.

13
00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:56.284
"We’ll talk later about school, kids," said Mom.

14
00:00:56.285 --> 00:00:59.857
Vinnie and Mandy ran up to the attic.

15
00:00:59.858 --> 00:01:02.047
"Can you believe it?

16
00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:06.149
Our last photo trip," said Mandy.

17
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.834
She hugged the album.

18
00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:13.117
"Well, let’s do it!" cried Vinnie.

19
00:01:13.118 --> 00:01:17.127
Mandy opened the album to the last page.

20
00:01:17.128 --> 00:01:22.591
The old man stood in a beautiful cathedral with tall columns.

21
00:01:22.592 --> 00:01:27.065
The old man held a glowing object in his hands.

22
00:01:27.066 --> 00:01:32.471
"A book?" asked Mandy, looking at the glowing object.

23
00:01:32.472 --> 00:01:34.909
"What do you think, Vinnie?"

24
00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:38.275
"No use guessing," he said.

25
00:01:38.276 --> 00:01:41.031
"We’ll find out soon!"

26
00:01:41.032 --> 00:01:47.175
The children’s eyes closed, and they fell down the dark tunnel.

27
00:01:47.176 --> 00:01:52.986
Vinnie and Mandy landed on a stone floor and opened their eyes.

28
00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:57.473
Mandy was wearing a long dress with long sleeves.

29
00:01:57.474 --> 00:02:01.466
Vinnie wore stockings and a short tunic.

30
00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:06.059
"We’re in some kind of storage room," said Vinnie.

31
00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:11.826
Stacks of paper, brushes, and rags were piled around them.

32
00:02:11.827 --> 00:02:15.716
Hammers and other tools were scattered about.

33
00:02:15.717 --> 00:02:20.797
Large, flat panels of wood leaned against the wall.

34
00:02:20.798 --> 00:02:24.358
"It must be a painter’s storage room,"

35
00:02:24.359 --> 00:02:28.236
said Mandy, picking up a paint brush.

36
00:02:28.237 --> 00:02:33.522
The door opened, and a boy a little older than Vinnie walked in.

37
00:02:33.523 --> 00:02:36.494
He was thin with curly hair.

38
00:02:36.495 --> 00:02:39.848
He stared at Vinnie and Mandy.

39
00:02:39.849 --> 00:02:44.288
"Oh, hello," Mandy said nervously.

40
00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:48.360
"What are you guys doing here?" the boy asked.

41
00:02:48.361 --> 00:02:52.743
"We were just . . . ," stammered Vinnie.

42
00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:56.234
"You are not from here," the boy said.

43
00:02:56.235 --> 00:03:00.482
"How did you know?" asked Mandy.

44
00:03:00.483 --> 00:03:06.850
"No one would come into Master Verrocchio’s workshop uninvited," the boy said.

45
00:03:06.851 --> 00:03:09.760
The children looked embarrassed.

46
00:03:09.761 --> 00:03:14.870
"We don’t know our way around," Vinnie said.

47
00:03:14.871 --> 00:03:17.180
The boy smiled warmly.

48
00:03:17.181 --> 00:03:20.667
"I can show you the city," he said.

49
00:03:20.668 --> 00:03:23.759
"But I must see the master first."

50
00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:28.514
The boy picked up a stack of rags and some brushes.

51
00:03:28.515 --> 00:03:31.012
"Have you worked for your master long?"

52
00:03:31.013 --> 00:03:35.001
asked Vinnie, thinking the boy was a servant.

53
00:03:35.002 --> 00:03:37.535
"He is not my master.

54
00:03:37.536 --> 00:03:40.547
He is the master of this workshop.

55
00:03:40.548 --> 00:03:44.358
I am his student," said the boy.

56
00:03:44.359 --> 00:03:47.406
"Student?" asked Vinnie.

57
00:03:47.407 --> 00:03:50.686
The boy looked at him and replied,

58
00:03:50.687 --> 00:03:58.298
"I am studying to become the greatest artist in the world."

